to 2326.32, 2326.31 to 2515.30, with the window high 2771 printed on bar 89.", "Bars 90-116 are two-sided: overlapping bodies, highs at 2557.46 (bar 95) and 2609.02 (bar 113), lows clustered 2357.18-2425.44; bar 110 spiked to 2680 and closed 2514.72 back inside the range.", "Bars 117-119 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90 \u2014 the first consecutive closes above the 2557.46 ceiling; bar 117 has open 2446.22, high 2643.52, low 2436.87, range 206.65, closing in its top quarter; bar 118 reaches 2700.", "Bar 119 (open 2632.98, high 2645.88, low 2568.16, close 2642.90) is a 77.72-range bar closing near its high while holding above the range ceiling; it makes a lower high than bar 118 (2645.88 vs 2700).", "Recent lows rise: 2357.18 (bar 101), 2358.62 (bar 114), 2370.54 (bar 115), 2413.82 (bar 116), 2436.87 (bar 117), 2568.16 (bar 119).", "Price 2642.90 remains below the bar-89 spike high 2771, so the post-spike section is not yet a confirmed new-high trend."], "phase": "breakout-spike", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Opening bear leg: a run of lower highs and lower lows from 2116.86 (first open) to 1368.42 (bar 13 low), with widening ranges into bars 9-13 (2006.06->1859.02, 1859.01->1813.04, 1813.04->1731.00, 1731.00->1581.32, 1581.32->1568.55).", "end_time_ms": 1780704000000, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1779580800000, "upper_boundary": "2139.34"}, {"description": "Selling climax / possible mtr-like low area: bar 13 prints the window low 1368.42 with its close 1568.55 well above that low, and bar 14 reverses to close 1687.83 near its high (high 1690.78) after opening 1568.55.", "end_time_ms": 1780790400000, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780617600000, "upper_boundary": "1690.78"}, {"description": "Bull sequence from the window low: rising swing lows 1512.91/1533.12, 1821.49, 2357.18, 2358.62 punctuated by consolidations (about 1512-1725, 1850-1975, 2357-2557); successive bull legs reached 1954.36 (bar 59) and 2771 (bar 89).", "end_time_ms": 1789948799999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Two-sided trading range after the bar-87..89 spike: overlapping bars between the 2357.18 low (bar 101) and the 2557.46 high (bar 95), with two upside probes that closed back inside \u2014 2680 high closing 2514.72 (bar 110) and 2609.02 high closing 2514.07 (bar 113).", "end_time_ms": 1789689599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2557.46"}, {"description": "Upside breakout attempt from that range: bars 117-119 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90, the first closes above the 2557.46 ceiling, with bar 118 printing 2700, the highest high since the 2771 spike of bar 89.", "end_time_ms": 1789948799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2436.87", "start_time_ms": 1789603200000, "upper_boundary": "2700"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Continuation: additional closes above 2700 with rising closes would indicate acceptance above the range, shifting focus to the 2771 bar-89 spike high.", "Failure: closes back below 2568.16 (bar 119 low) and then 2557.46 would indicate a failed breakout and a return into the 2357.18-2557.46 range.", "A close below 2357.18 would remove the two-sided floor and support a broader range-breakdown or bear-leg read.", "Repeated closes between 2557.46 and 2700 without progress would mark a new, higher trading range rather than a continuation trend."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1789977599999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The advance is pressing the top of a large trading range, and that level has already rejected price once: 1789804800000 hit 2700.00 and closed 2638.49 (61.50 upper tail), while the earlier spike high 2680.00 (1789128000000) was followed by a 250.40 decline to 2358.62.", "The last two bars hesitate: 1789948800000 leaves a 35.27 upper tail from 2664.73 to 2700.00, and 1789963200000 is an inside bar closing 2658.81, below its open and in the lower half of its range.", "The container of the second half is still a range (2358.62-2700.00), and the window's first 60 bars were a two-sided range (2411.04-2528.80) plus a failed spike at 2680.00, so range behavior has repeatedly capped upside probes.", "Net window change is only +189.84 with two deep bear legs (2537.57 to 2436.73 at 1788523200000; 2609.02 to 2358.62 by 1789488000000), which is consistent with broad range trade rather than a clean sustained trend."], "evidence_for": ["Higher highs and higher lows for about 32 bars: from the 2358.62 low (1789488000000) swing lows rose to 2370.54, 2436.87, 2495.82 and 2608.83, while swing highs rose from 2425.53 (1789545600000) to 2643.52 (1789747200000) and then to 2700.00 (1789948800000).", "Momentum is visible in trend bars: 1789732800000 and 1789747200000 are consecutive large bull bars (2507.15-2578.60, 2579.97-2636.28) gaining about 129 points with minimal overlap, and 1789905600000 closes exactly at its high 2611.00.", "The only significant pullback in the advance, to 2568.16 (1789891200000), retraced about 26% of the 2358.62-2643.52 leg, stayed above the prior higher low 2495.82, and was immediately bought.", "Price closed the window at 2658.81, about 300 points above the 2358.62 low and near the top of the 120-bar window, with the last five bars making no lower low in sequence."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed H4 bars supplied, opening 1788249600000 at 2469.43 and ending with the bar closing 1789977599999 at 2658.81 (+189.84, about +7.7% over the window).", "Window extremes: low 2357.18 (1788336000000, early window) and high 2